        "title": "别换场景，换你想让人看见的地方",
        "html": "<small>视觉示意 · 非镜头光学仿真</small><h3>先点一个主体，再决定让多少背景清楚</h3><div class=\"scene\"><div id=\"street\" class=\"street\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"对焦街道\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>远处街道</span></div><div id=\"plant\" class=\"plant\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"对焦植物\"><i>♧</i><span>窗边植物</span></div><div id=\"cup\" class=\"cup\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"对焦杯子\"><i></i><span>近处杯子</span></div></div><label>清晰范围<input id=\"depth\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\"></label><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"shoot\">留作对照</button><button id=\"reset\">复位</button></div><output id=\"status\"></output><div id=\"photo\"></div><p class=\"note\">点远近主体改变焦点；扩大范围使其他距离也相对清楚。模糊半径只表达关系，不对应真实光圈数值。</p>",
        "js": "const __name=(fn)=>fn;\nconst q=__name(s=>document.querySelector(s),\"q\");let focus=0;const ids=[\"cup\",\"plant\",\"street\"],names=[\"\\u676F\\u5B50\",\"\\u690D\\u7269\",\"\\u8857\\u9053\"];function draw(){const depth=+q(\"#depth\").value;ids.forEach((id,i)=>q(\"#\"+id).style.filter=\"blur(\"+Math.max(0,Math.abs(i-focus)-depth)*3+\"px)\");q(\"#status\").textContent=\"\\u5BF9\\u7126\\uFF1A\"+names[focus]+\" \\xB7 \\u6E05\\u6670\\u8303\\u56F4\\uFF1A\"+[\"\\u7A84\",\"\\u4E2D\",\"\\u5BBD\"][depth]}__name(draw,\"draw\");ids.forEach((id,i)=>{q(\"#\"+id).onclick=()=>{focus=i;draw()};q(\"#\"+id).onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key===\"Enter\"||e.key===\" \"){e.preventDefault();focus=i;draw()}}});q(\"#depth\").oninput=draw;q(\"#shoot\").onclick=()=>{q(\"#photo\").innerHTML=\"<small>\\u521A\\u624D\\u7684\\u9009\\u62E9\\uFF1A\"+q(\"#status\").textContent+\"</small>\"+q(\".scene\").outerHTML;q(\"#photo\").querySelectorAll(\"[id]\").forEach(el=>{el.removeAttribute(\"id\");el.removeAttribute(\"tabindex\");el.removeAttribute(\"role\")})};q(\"#reset\").onclick=()=>{focus=0;q(\"#depth\").value=0;q(\"#photo\").innerHTML=\"\";draw()};draw()",
        "css": "body{padding:16px;color:var(--ink,#183a35);background:var(--paper,#f2f5ed)}h3,p{margin:0 0 12px}h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.25}small,.note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#526b62)}.row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}button{border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;padding:8px 12px;min-height:42px}button[aria-pressed=true],button.primary{background:var(--ink,#183a35);color:var(--paper,#f2f5ed)}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px;gap:4px;min-width:0}input[type=number],select{border:1px solid #9baaa2;background:#fff;color:#16332e;border-radius:4px;padding:8px;width:100%;min-width:0}input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--ink,#183a35)}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.metrics{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:14px 0}.metrics b{font-size:26px;line-height:1.2;display:block;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.metrics span{font-size:12px}.visual{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}output{display:block}button:disabled{opacity:.35}svg text{font-family:inherit}.note{margin-top:12px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:420px){body{padding:12px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.metrics b{font-size:23px}h3{font-size:19px}}body{--ink:#624b36;--paper:#f7f1e5;--muted:#796e55}.scene{position:relative;height:250px;background:linear-gradient(#adc5cd 0 70%,#b89568 70%);overflow:hidden;border-radius:6px}.scene span{background:#fffc;padding:3px;font-size:12px;color:#433724}.scene [role=button]{cursor:crosshair}.street{position:absolute;top:10px;right:5%;width:70%;height:160px}.street i{display:inline-block;height:100%;width:27%;margin:2%;background:repeating-linear-gradient(#8c9294 0 20px,#d2dee0 20px 27px)}.street span{position:absolute;right:0;top:0}.plant{position:absolute;left:12%;top:50px}.plant i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:120px;line-height:1;color:#34574b}.cup{position:absolute;right:10%;bottom:18px}.cup i{display:block;width:85px;height:60px;background:#f9e8d5;border-radius:4px 4px 28px 28px;border-right:10px solid #ddc5a5}#photo{margin-top:12px}#photo .scene{pointer-events:none;opacity:.9}",
